WEBVTT

00:00:08.097 --> 00:00:09.297
Kid, you okay?

00:00:09.497 --> 00:00:10.977
Smokey, I need Cruz!

00:00:11.137 --> 00:00:12.177
Never mind that now.

00:00:12.217 --> 00:00:13.497
No! I need her back here.

00:00:13.577 --> 00:00:15.017
Now!

00:00:15.497 --> 00:00:17.097
MIKE: The yellow flag still out, folks.

00:00:17.257 --> 00:00:18.417
Wrecked cars everywhere.
We're still trying to figure--

00:00:19.057 --> 00:00:21.697
HAMILTON: Hamilton here.
Call from Chester Whipplefilter.

00:00:21.857 --> 00:00:24.257
Chester-- Mr. McQueen?

00:00:24.617 --> 00:00:27.617
The green light's on, pit road is open,
and everybody's coming in.

00:00:28.697 --> 00:00:31.977
Get ready, guys.
Luigi, Guido, tires! Fillmore, fuel!

00:00:32.137 --> 00:00:33.937
Okay, I'm here. What's going on?

00:00:34.977 --> 00:00:37.177
No! Not me! Her.

00:00:37.217 --> 00:00:38.937
-ALL: Huh?
-What?

00:00:39.137 --> 00:00:40.857
-What is she doing back here?
-Come on, guys! Get her set up!

00:00:41.057 --> 00:00:43.377
-Okay! Hot tires!
-Wait! What's happening?

00:00:43.617 --> 00:00:45.177
Hey, Ramone! You got your paints?

00:00:45.377 --> 00:00:48.697
-You know I do!
-CRUZ: Guys! What are you doing?

00:00:49.177 --> 00:00:51.697
Man, I don't understand it!
McQueen's just sitting there.

00:00:51.777 --> 00:00:52.937
Something's got to be wrong.

00:00:53.177 --> 00:00:54.017
Mr. McQueen?

00:00:54.217 --> 00:00:56.057
Today's the day, Cruz.
You're getting your shot.

00:00:56.177 --> 00:00:56.857
What?

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:59.457
I started this race
and you're gonna finish it.

00:00:59.977 --> 00:01:03.777
What? She'll damage the brand!
She's just a trainer!

00:01:03.977 --> 00:01:06.897
No, she's a racer.
Just took me awhile to see it.

00:01:07.297 --> 00:01:08.217
That can't be legal!

00:01:08.897 --> 00:01:10.577
The rules only say
the number has to be out there.

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.177
Doesn't say who has to wear it.

00:01:12.417 --> 00:01:16.497
-No! You can't do that--
-Did I tell you I love your mudflaps?

00:01:16.697 --> 00:01:17.817
Out of my way, bumpkin!

00:01:18.097 --> 00:01:20.257
Got my fishing flaps,
got my church flaps,

00:01:20.297 --> 00:01:21.937
my going out and eating flaps.

00:01:24.177 --> 00:01:26.697
McQUEEN: Come on, guys!
We got to get her out there! Let's go!

00:01:26.897 --> 00:01:28.097
-Tires, check!
-Fuel, check!

00:01:28.217 --> 00:01:28.897
Ramone?

00:01:29.137 --> 00:01:31.697
-Best I could do in the time frame, boss.
-(ENGINE REVVING)

00:01:32.217 --> 00:01:35.137
Yeah. (CHUCKLES) That'll work.

00:01:35.417 --> 00:01:36.817
Why are you doing this?

00:01:36.977 --> 00:01:39.617
You said it yourself,
this might be your last chance.

00:01:39.817 --> 00:01:41.617
Which makes it my last chance

00:01:41.697 --> 00:01:44.097
to give you your first chance, Cruz.

00:01:45.097 --> 00:01:46.857
And this time I want you to take it.

00:01:48.977 --> 00:01:51.017
She's got to beat that pace car out.

00:01:52.737 --> 00:01:54.777
-No! You can't do that!
-Now or never.

00:01:56.017 --> 00:01:57.017
What do you say?

00:01:59.457 --> 00:02:01.897
Whoa! Hey! 35-mile-per-hour pit speed!

00:02:02.457 --> 00:02:03.177
CRUZ: I knew that!

00:02:11.017 --> 00:02:14.737
McQueen's team has entered
a different car sporting the 95.

00:02:14.937 --> 00:02:16.137
I don't believe what I'm seeing!

00:02:16.297 --> 00:02:17.577
You're watching this, right?

00:02:17.857 --> 00:02:19.377
What, the girl in the costume?

00:02:19.457 --> 00:02:21.697
You're kidding me.
He put her in the race?

00:02:25.977 --> 00:02:27.457
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:02:32.097 --> 00:02:34.577
CUTLASS: The green flag is out
and we're back to racing.

00:02:35.137 --> 00:02:35.977
(EXCLAIMS)

00:02:38.617 --> 00:02:40.537
SMOKEY: Cruz? What are you doing?

00:02:40.777 --> 00:02:42.817
Come on. Pick it up!
You got to go faster.

00:02:43.137 --> 00:02:44.817
Call her Frances Beltline

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:47.697
and tell her the school bus
of death is after her.

00:02:47.937 --> 00:02:49.697
-What? No.
-Trust me.

00:02:50.617 --> 00:02:53.777
Uh, Frances Beltline,

00:02:53.857 --> 00:02:55.177
the school bus of death is after you.

00:02:56.457 --> 00:02:59.297
What? Oh, uh... (STUTTERS) Right.

00:03:00.177 --> 00:03:01.937
Okay, that was different.

00:03:03.617 --> 00:03:05.457
SMOKEY: Cruz, you're
looking too tight now.

00:03:05.657 --> 00:03:06.817
Come on. Loosen up.

00:03:07.057 --> 00:03:09.337
-Tell her she's a fluffy cloud.
-What? No.

00:03:09.577 --> 00:03:10.417
Smokey, tell her.

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:15.937
Uh, Cruz, you are a fluffy cloud.

00:03:16.497 --> 00:03:18.857
Oh, right. Uh, too tight.

00:03:18.937 --> 00:03:21.497
I'm a fluffy cloud. I'm a fluffy cloud.

00:03:24.017 --> 00:03:25.417
-(BRAKES SQUEALING)
-Uh...

00:03:25.537 --> 00:03:27.377
SMOKEY: Anticipate your turns.

00:03:27.617 --> 00:03:28.577
Cruz! Get your head in the race.

00:03:29.217 --> 00:03:31.417
(STUTTERING)
Tell her she's on a beach

00:03:31.617 --> 00:03:33.737
and all the little crabbies
have gone night-night.

00:03:35.297 --> 00:03:37.617
No! I ain't saying that. You tell her.

00:03:39.617 --> 00:03:41.057
McQUEEN: All right, Cruz. The beach.

00:03:41.097 --> 00:03:42.457
I need you to think of the beach.

00:03:42.657 --> 00:03:45.097
-Mr. McQueen?
-Yeah. It's me. Remember the beach.

00:03:45.777 --> 00:03:47.977
Oh, pick a line, stick to it. Got it.

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:52.337
All right. Not too bad.

00:03:52.817 --> 00:03:54.457
This is nothing like the simulator.

00:03:55.017 --> 00:03:58.177
You got every tool you need.
Now remember Thomasville.

00:03:58.257 --> 00:03:59.377
-Thomasville?
-Yeah.

00:03:59.417 --> 00:04:00.457
Sneak through the window.

00:04:00.737 --> 00:04:02.377
Now that I understand.

00:04:02.617 --> 00:04:04.057
Sneak through the window.

00:04:06.097 --> 00:04:07.177
(MOOING)

00:04:15.417 --> 00:04:16.537
(GRUNTING)

00:04:21.897 --> 00:04:23.937
CUTLASS: We're just learning
that the racer

00:04:24.017 --> 00:04:26.417
replacing McQueen is Cruz Ramirez.

00:04:26.497 --> 00:04:28.137
This is her very first race!

00:04:28.217 --> 00:04:30.057
Actually, Darrell, it says here

00:04:30.097 --> 00:04:31.897
she does have one win under her belt.

00:04:32.057 --> 00:04:34.177
At a place called Thunder Hollow?

00:04:34.697 --> 00:04:37.417
Thunder Hollow!
She said Thunder Hollow!

00:04:39.417 --> 00:04:41.577
Try moving half a lane. Half a lane.

00:04:41.777 --> 00:04:43.497
-Got it.
-All right, watch that lap car.

00:04:43.617 --> 00:04:47.657
He's gonna go high.
Go low! Go low! Nice job.

00:04:47.897 --> 00:04:49.377
You are smoking these guys.

00:04:50.137 --> 00:04:53.137
Now watch the tire marbles along
turn three. Keep your tires clean.

00:04:53.217 --> 00:04:54.897
-Okay.
-Bump coming up on the inside.

00:04:54.977 --> 00:04:56.337
Careful you don't go airborne.

00:04:56.417 --> 00:04:57.657
-Now?
-Yes. Now!

00:04:57.857 --> 00:05:01.017
Watch out by the wall, it's a little
slick there. Watch it, watch it, watch it.

00:05:01.457 --> 00:05:02.977
(CRUZ SQUEALING)

00:05:03.057 --> 00:05:06.137
You have hit a wall. You have hit a wall.

00:05:06.297 --> 00:05:08.577
Ha-ha. Just being aggressive.

00:05:11.377 --> 00:05:15.017
Okay, I want you to pit.
Watch your RPM.

00:05:15.177 --> 00:05:17.617
Get out of the gas.
On the brake. On the brake.

00:05:17.777 --> 00:05:18.657
Too fast!

00:05:18.737 --> 00:05:19.897
Uh, we're back here.

00:05:20.057 --> 00:05:20.897
Sorry.

00:05:21.777 --> 00:05:24.377
All right.
Pick 'em off one at a time. Go, go, go!

00:05:27.057 --> 00:05:29.017
That's it. Nice and straight.

00:05:30.097 --> 00:05:31.177
Whoo-hoo!

00:05:32.097 --> 00:05:34.657
Go, go, go, go! Smokey, you watching?

00:05:34.697 --> 00:05:36.137
(LAUGHING)

00:05:39.777 --> 00:05:42.457
Just wanted to let you know
Ramirez is moving up toward you.

00:05:42.617 --> 00:05:44.137
(SCOFFS) Why should I care?

00:05:44.177 --> 00:05:45.937
Because now she's in the top 10!

00:05:49.057 --> 00:05:51.697
Okay. Now you're coming up
on the leaders.

00:05:58.777 --> 00:06:02.177
-CREW CHIEF: Ramirez up to fourth.
-In fourth? Huh.

00:06:04.457 --> 00:06:06.097
(WHOOPING) Get 'er done!

00:06:08.977 --> 00:06:10.857
CREW CHIEF: Ramirez is in third.

00:06:18.617 --> 00:06:20.377
What are you doing, Storm?

00:06:21.377 --> 00:06:23.937
Hey! Costume Girl.

00:06:24.017 --> 00:06:25.377
You know, at first I thought
you were out here...

00:06:25.417 --> 00:06:26.937
because your GPS was broken.

00:06:27.017 --> 00:06:28.257
Don't listen to him, Cruz!

00:06:28.337 --> 00:06:29.417
JACKSON STORM: You look good!

00:06:29.497 --> 00:06:30.897
It's important to look the part.

00:06:30.977 --> 00:06:32.177
You can't have everyone thinking

00:06:32.337 --> 00:06:33.977
that you don't deserve to be here.

00:06:34.057 --> 00:06:35.377
He's trying to get in your head!

00:06:35.897 --> 00:06:37.897
They don't need to know
what you and I already do.

00:06:38.657 --> 00:06:41.377
That you can play dress-up all you want,

00:06:41.497 --> 00:06:43.977
but you'll never be one of us.

00:06:51.537 --> 00:06:53.177
Cruz, did you see what happened there?

00:06:53.417 --> 00:06:55.817
Yeah. (STUTTERS) He's in my head.

00:06:56.097 --> 00:06:57.737
No! Listen to me.

00:06:57.777 --> 00:07:00.697
You got into his head.
Don't you understand?

00:07:00.897 --> 00:07:04.497
He would never have done that
if you didn't scare him.

00:07:04.577 --> 00:07:05.497
What?

00:07:05.657 --> 00:07:08.537
He sees something in you
that you don't even see in yourself.

00:07:09.217 --> 00:07:13.057
You made me believe it,
now you got to believe it too.

00:07:14.457 --> 00:07:16.577
You are a racer.

00:07:17.377 --> 00:07:18.697
Use that.

